Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Unsummon.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Forest)
Bot1.Pass
